  "description": "Someone stole my movie from the future! \n\nA-Ram, who happened to go to the future, saw an impressive movie there and returned to make the same movie, but that work was a work for which Ga-Eun and U-Bin, who are currently film students, had just completed the script. A-Ram, realizing this fact, is obsessed with the desire to create her own work and tries to eliminate Ga-Eun and U-Bin. Ga-Eun and U-Bin fight against A-Ram to survive and to retrieve their future and precious works that were stolen by A-Ram. \n\n(Source: Naver, translated and edited)",
